x101 call open x100 9
x102 write x101 4
x103 write x102 3
x104 text "/docs/"
x105 puts x103 x104
x106 write x105 2
x107 text "Docs"
x108 puts x106 x107
x109 call close x108 
x110 call open x109 9
x111 write x110 4
x112 write x111 3
x113 text "/#benchmarks"
x114 puts x112 x113
x115 write x114 2
x116 text "Benchmarks"
